message: "If you use this project or its checks, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Cassie flow project"
authors:
  - name: "weft"
license: "Apache-2.0 OR MIT"
abstract: >-
  A headless Godot project that drives the cassie pen / mesh / curvenet
  operators exposed by modules/cassie in V-Sekai-fire/entities-godot at
  feat/module-cassie and checks the beautifier, curvenet extractor,
  patch pipeline, and constraint solver against recorded goldens, with
  planted controls for every check.
